const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"研究问题",en:"Research question"},body:{zh:"论文以香港市场证据考察卖空约束与价格发现，并以当地证券制度作为研究解释的前提。 阅读时应把它理解为受样本、时点和制度限定的问题，而不是可以脱离条件的结论。",en:"The article examines short-sales constraints and price discovery using evidence from the Hong Kong market. Read it as a bounded question, not as a conclusion that automatically travels beyond its sample, dates, or institutional setting."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1540-6261.2007.01270.x",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (2007) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (2007) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"研究设计",en:"Research design"},body:{zh:"它比较卖空资格与约束规则下的证券或时期，制度定义和政策时点至关重要。 比较对象、观察窗口和对照关系共同构成研究合同；改变其中一项，可能改变所检验的命题。",en:"It compares securities or periods under the market's short-sale eligibility and constraint rules, making the regime definition and policy timing essential. The comparison, observation window, and control relation are part of the research contract; changing one can change the proposition being tested."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1540-6261.2007.01270.x",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (2007) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (2007) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"数据与时点",en:"Data and timing"},body:{zh:"需要带日期的卖空资格、借券或约束代理、股票和市场价格、交易数据、上市状态、股份类别和政策事件日期。 字段定义、可得时点和样本筛选需要与原研究分别记录，不能仅因变量同名或使用最新修订值就视为可比。",en:"Required inputs include dated short-sale eligibility, borrowing or constraint proxies, stock and market prices, trading data, listing status, shares or classes, and policy-event dates. Keep fields, availability timing, and sample filters separate from the original study: a same-named variable or later-revised database is not automatically comparable."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1540-6261.2007.01270.x",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (2007) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (2007) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"如何理解结果",en:"How to read the result"},body:{zh:"研究针对特定香港制度下的价格发现，不意味着卖空在所有情况下稳定或扰乱市场。 它只支持来源所描述的经验或理论关系，不能把相关性、模型拟合或历史表现升级为因果、可执行性或未来保证。",en:"The study is about price discovery under a specific Hong Kong institutional setting; it does not make short-selling universally stabilizing or destabilizing. This remains the empirical or theoretical relation described by the source; it does not turn association, fit, or historical performance into causality, an executable procedure, or a future guarantee."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1540-6261.2007.01270.x",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (2007) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (2007) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"复核清单",en:"Replication checks"},body:{zh:"保留历史资格和规则版本；区分卖空余额、借券可得性和已执行卖空；对齐政策日期与交易时段和停牌。 开展后续分析前，应将这些选择写入版本化研究记录，并保留原始来源链接与访问日期。",en:"Preserve historical eligibility and rule versions; distinguish short interest, borrowing availability, and executed short sales; align policy dates with market sessions and suspensions. Before extending the analysis, record these choices in a versioned note and retain the primary-source link and access date."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1540-6261.2007.01270.x",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (2007) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (2007) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"适用边界",en:"Scope boundary"},body:{zh:"该条导读引用 The Journal of Finance (2007)。香港规则、市场设计和样本时期限制其向其他交易所、资产或当前监管决策的外推。 如需数值结论、参数、表格或稳健性检验，请回到原文并单独核对版本、附录与样本定义。",en:"This guide cites The Journal of Finance (2007). Hong Kong's rules, market design, and sample period limit extrapolation to other exchanges, assets, or current regulatory decisions. For numerical conclusions, parameters, tables, or robustness tests, return to the original and separately verify the edition, appendices, and sample definitions."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1540-6261.2007.01270.x",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (2007) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (2007) · source description"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本文只整理“Short-Sales Constraints and Price Discovery: Evidence from the Hong Kong Market”公开说明的研究对象与设计边界，不构成收益预测、交易规则或全文复现。香港规则、市场设计和样本时期限制其向其他交易所、资产或当前监管决策的外推。",en:"This guide only organizes the publicly described question and design of “Short-Sales Constraints and Price Discovery: Evidence from the Hong Kong Market”. It is not a return forecast, trading rule, or full-text replication. The source's stated scope remains controlling."}};export{e as default};
